      guideFront: "Set the \"rules of engagement\" when...",
      guideBack: "A firm, heartful boundary.",
      description: "Defining the \"culture\" or the physical/emotional boundaries within which the relationship operates.\nIt works because the Feminine feels safer when there is a known \"container\" for her emotions and for the couple's time.\n\n• \"No fighting on date night. Tonight is just for connection.\"\n• \"We stay in the room until we re-establish connection, even if we're mad.\"\n\nVariants:\n1. Conflict Rules — establishing how you will handle arguments.\n2. The Prophylactic Frame — setting a positive intention before a potentially stressful event.\n\nMindset: Leading her into a healthy container is an act of love for the relationship.",
